      <p class="eyebrow-sub">Cross-corporate competitor framing</p>
      <h2>Pitco vs Frymaster — cross-corporate competitors, not Ali Group siblings</h2>
      <p>Common SERP confusion conflates Pitco and Frymaster as Ali Group sibling brands. That framing is structurally wrong, and it matters for parts pipelines and single-call positioning.</p>

      <p><strong>Corporate families differ.</strong> Pitco is Middleby Corporation family (via the Blodgett 1981 acquisition chain — Pitco has been Middleby for roughly two decades). Frymaster is Ali Group family (via the July 2022 Welbilt acquisition). Different acquisition histories, different parts pipelines (Middleby distribution for Pitco vs Ali Group NA at Winston-Salem for Frymaster).</p>

      <p><strong>Different sibling brands for single-call.</strong> Pitco's Middleby siblings (Blodgett, Southbend, Imperial, TurboChef, MagiKitch'n, Wells, Ultrafryer, Anets) are different from Frymaster's Ali Group siblings (Garland, US Range, Manitowoc, Lincoln, Champion, CMA, Convotherm, Kolpak, Master-Bilt, Delfield, Beverage-Air, Merrychef). For multi-brand LA kitchens, that distinction shapes which single-call workflow applies.</p>

      <p><strong>Different LA segment fit + filtration mechanisms.</strong> Pitco dominates LA independent restaurants, ethnic-cuisine kitchens, hotel banquet, stadium concessions, mid-tier chains. Frymaster dominates McDonald's franchise operations (50+ year OEM lock, 200+ LA County franchises). Pitco Solstice Supreme uses FilterMate (pump-and-paper with O-ring sealed manifold); Frymaster FilterQuick (FQE/FQG) uses a different manifold-based architecture.</p>

      <p><strong>Buyer recommendation by use case.</strong> Non-franchise independent: Pitco Solstice Supreme (broadest US install + Middleby family scale). McDonald's franchise: Frymaster non-negotiable. Ethnic cuisine + heavy-sediment: Pitco SFSG open-pot. High-volume parallel: Pitco Multi-Battery + Megafry. CARB rebate-eligible: Pitco SSH. We service both lines with parts infrastructure across both corporate families. See our <a href="/brands/frymaster/">Frymaster commercial fryer service page</a> for FilterQuick architecture detail.</p>
